Harbor
================================================================================

Upstream: https://github.com/harbor-framework/harbor
Dependency version: 0.24.0
License: Apache License 2.0

ForgeFlow uses Harbor's environment lifecycle, installed-agent interface, and
run/verification organization. Harbor is a Python dependency and is not
vendored in this public snapshot.

================================================================================
WayRaft and DeepTutor
================================================================================

WayRaft: https://github.com/KevinXia69/WayRaft (Apache License 2.0)
DeepTutor: https://github.com/KevinXia69/DeepTutor (Apache License 2.0)

ForgeFlow's workbench layout and interaction language were inspired by WayRaft,
including the left navigation rail, restrained neutral palette, centered input
area, and time-of-day greeting pattern. The settings-panel organization was
inspired by DeepTutor. These projects are attribution references only: no
WayRaft or DeepTutor source code, components, backends, private records, or
brand assets are copied into this public snapshot. The Apache License 2.0 terms
of those projects continue to apply to those projects.

