Odoo and Google OR-Tools
================================================================================

Odoo is used as an external container image for the task environment and is not
redistributed here. Google OR-Tools is an optional dependency used by the
planning tools and is resolved through the dependency lock. Their upstream
licenses and notices continue to apply to those projects.

